<content><![CDATA[<p>Texture a set of low-poly assets with a single shared color-palette texture, a common technique for stylized games.</p>
<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>
<ol>
<li>Unwrap UVs onto a shared palette texture</li>
<li>Use one material across many assets</li>
<li>Keep a consistent stylized color scheme</li>
</ol>
